A desirable property of a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/lambda-calculus.td")} where every term all evaluates to a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/normal-form.td")}, whether they become ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/stuck-term.td")} or Value. This property may not hold in most systems.
